    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>

    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 127?</summary><p>In order: 1) Drag the file from the colleague's hand to the girl.; 2) Drag the phone to the girl.; 3) Click to open the left door.; 4) Drag the clock to the girl.; 5) Drag the remote from the boss's pocket to the air conditioner.; 6) Drag the file on the table to the boss.; 7) Drag the baby to the boy.; 8) Click to open the right door.; 9) Drag the bowl to the boy.; 10) Drag the rag to the boy.; 11) Drag the plunger to the boy.; 12) Double-click to open the window.; 13) Drag the chicken to the boy.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why does nothing happen when I tap in Level 127?</summary><p>Because nothing on this screen answers a plain tap: all 13 moves are 10 drags. Hold, then drag or swipe exactly as the step card says. In Brain Puzzle 3 a drag that starts on the wrong prop simply snaps back, which looks like a tap doing nothing.</p></details>
